GAL22V10
UPLDYEQ

CLK   P0    P1    P2    P3    P4    P5    P6    P7    Q0   Q1   GND
Q2    Q3    Q4    Q5    Q6    Q7    NElo  NEhi  EQ    NC   NC   VCC

NElo = P0 * /Q0 + /P0 * Q0 +
       P1 * /Q1 + /P1 * Q1 +
       P2 * /Q2 + /P2 * Q2 +
       P3 * /Q3 + /P3 * Q3

NEhi = P4 * /Q4 + /P4 * Q4 +
       P5 * /Q5 + /P5 * Q5 +
       P6 * /Q6 + /P6 * Q6 +
       P7 * /Q7 + /P7 * Q7

EQ = NElo + NEhi

DESCRIPTION
UPLDY 8-bit inequality (EQ high when P!=Q) via cascaded helpers.
